{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1159281-moving-bodies-from-the-umbra","id":1159281,"title":"Moving bodies from the Umbra","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-15T18:33:41-08:00","id":1159281,"title":"Moving bodies from the Umbra","content":"This has happened quite some times in my campaigns, so I'm curious.<br /> <br /> Let's say there is an unconscious Garou in the Umbra. Can you pull it out and back into the real world? How? And what if the Garou is dead, can you carry his lifeless body to the other side?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13673-maris-streck","name":"Maris Streck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13673_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T18:17:44-08:00","id":1159652,"title":"","content":"If they are Pack then sure thing, you just lead the way for the pack. If they are not then that's trickier and requires a Gift, a very low gauntlet or some other spiritual assistance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T23:22:42-08:00","id":1159729,"title":"","content":"The manual though says that every Garou needs to be &quot;willing&quot; to move to the other side and one can't surely be willing if he's unconscious...<br /> I know that Grasp the Beyond is certainly going to do the trick but I was looking for some low-level solutions. I might end up allowing the passage through &quot;leading the way&quot;, but I'd like to look for other solutions first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13673-maris-streck","name":"Maris Streck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13673_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T18:26:11-08:00","id":1160074,"title":"","content":"Leading the way would work (I'd consider unconscious packmates &quot;willing&quot; for these proposes), or traveling back through an opened Caern. <br /> <br /> You can get a decently powered spirit to do it too, if you can put up the right chiminage. And you should be able to ask the Garou in question's Totem to help it through. Tricky, though not impossible depending on the amount of time you have.<br /> <br /> That's all I got, off the top of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}